  {
   "id": 15,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    -210,
    -640
   ],
   "size": [
    370,
    420
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 1,
   "mode": 0,
   "showAdvanced": null,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Hunyuan3D-2.1 shape (ComfyUI native) + Paint on AMD\n\nThe shape subgraph is ComfyUI's own Hunyuan3D-2.1 template. The paint nodes texture its mesh with PBR materials.\n\nExample input: [3d_hunyuan3d-v2.1_input_image.png](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/refs/heads/main/input/3d_hunyuan3d-v2.1_input_image.png) (put it in `ComfyUI/input`)\n\n**Models**\n\n- [hunyuan_3d_v2.1.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/hunyuan3D_2.1_repackaged/resolve/main/hunyuan_3d_v2.1.safetensors) (7.4 GB) in `models/checkpoints`\n- [birefnet.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/BiRefNet/resolve/main/background_removal/birefnet.safetensors) in `models/background_removal`\n- The paint models download on first run (about 11 GB, once): Hunyuan3D-2.1 paint, DINOv2 giant and RealESRGAN x4, see the node pack README.\n\nStart ComfyUI with `--use-sage-attention` and install [SageAttention](https://github.com/TwelveNights/SageAttention-rocm) for the fast path.\n"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## Hunyuan3D-2.1 shape (ComfyUI native) + Paint on AMD\n\nThe shape subgraph is ComfyUI's own Hunyuan3D-2.1 template. The paint nodes texture its mesh with PBR materials.\n\nExample input: [3d_hunyuan3d-v2.1_input_image.png](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/refs/heads/main/input/3d_hunyuan3d-v2.1_input_image.png) (put it in `ComfyUI/input`)\n\n**Models**\n\n- [hunyuan_3d_v2.1.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/hunyuan3D_2.1_repackaged/resolve/main/hunyuan_3d_v2.1.safetensors) (7.4 GB) in `models/checkpoints`\n- [birefnet.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/BiRefNet/resolve/main/background_removal/birefnet.safetensors) in `models/background_removal`\n- The paint models download on first run (about 11 GB, once): Hunyuan3D-2.1 paint, DINOv2 giant and RealESRGAN x4, see the node pack README.\n\nStart ComfyUI with `--use-sage-attention` and install [SageAttention](https://github.com/TwelveNights/SageAttention-rocm) for the fast path.\n"
   },
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#000"
  },
